OL,3,GNEWSACity where 67,000 adults drink in
OL,4,Aexcess and what is being done to change
OL,5,Ait
OL,6,
OL,7,FLiverpool City Council has approved a
OL,8,Fnew five-year plan to curb binge
OL,9,Fdrinking and alcohol-related harm after
OL,10,Ffigures showed more than 67,000 adults
OL,11,Fin the city are estimated to drink to
OL,12,Fexcess.
OL,14,FAlcohol-related harm is estimated to
OL,15,Fcost Liverpool about #330m a year and
OL,16,Fis linked to thousands of hospital
OL,17,Fadmissions.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
