OL,3,GNEWSACity where 67,000 adults drink in
OL,4,Aexcess and what is being done to change
OL,5,Ait
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe strategy aims to "rebalance" the
OL,8,Fcity's relationship with alcohol while
OL,9,Frecognising the role pubs, bars and
OL,10,Frestaurants play in the local economy
OL,11,Fand nightlife, the council said.
OL,13,FCouncillor Harry Doyle said: "Is our
OL,14,Frelationship with alcohol the right
OL,15,Fone? Is it balanced? Right now, the
OL,16,Fanswer is no."
